inally posted by <strong>Flyboy254</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1122801-your-city-in-the-darkness?p=1130231#post1130231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <img src=\"http://pa1.narvii.com/6119/b62ced98f6fb3498326cbb5718b1338f79b4bdd0_hq.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>yep .. lol<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T10:25:51-07:00","id":1130341,"title":"","content":"I'm in Tucson, so that's already covered in Mage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12476-voltron64","name":"Voltron64","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-17T17:42:27-07:00","id":1130617,"title":"","content":"Oh gosh, I would have to think on that. I live in a small, safe, hipster college town in Ohio. Not even a population to support a single vampire. I suppose the area could be a corner of a werewolf pack. Spirits and other such weirdness hiding just below the surface of an already peculiar town.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user"